   stage S01 on all partitions :
      scan lineitem
     | gbyAgg &quot; groupBy  type INTEGER ( 19 ) as L_ORDERKEY L_ORDERKEY aggregates  type INTEGER ( 19 ) as L_ORDERKEY $K1 , type DECIMAL ( 19  2 ) as SUM_QTY )  L_QUANTITY sum  &quot;
     | combined 0
     | next

  stage S02 on origin :
     filter  &quot; type BOOLEAN  SUM_QTY 300.00  &gt;  &quot;
     | globalHash ORDERS GxO_ORDERKEY &quot;type INTEGER ( 19 ) L_ORDERKEY&quot;
     | combined 0
     | next hashcast

   stage S03 on all partitions multiple threads 4:
     indexJoin orders IxO_ORDERKEY &quot;bound $I1 $1 ==&quot;
